  "body": "My first experience with a large setup is that the push gateway is overloaded with requests coming from synapse. I believe the gateway is called for every pusher available. So if I have a chat group with say 10K users, all with active pushers and no push rules set, the gateway will receive 10K requests. This leads to performance issues on both sides.\r\n\r\nA simple solution for this example would be to bundle the push into 1 request, listing the devices with the push keys in the payload.\r\n",
